  "details": "The SDK3 Worlds SDK does not have access to the Animator State Behaviours that are accessible to SDK3 Avatars SDK. \nThis prevents World Creators from being able to properly apply VRC_Station Animator Overrides to avatars without having them break. \nThe only way to get them to work is to break the SDK by mixing the 2 versions. Now with VCC preventing mixing the 2 SDKs, creators are unable to use this workaround.\nSo please add these scripts to SDK3 Worlds so that creators can use them.",
